WEBVTT

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:03.600
I'm exhausted!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.100
What do we have now?

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:08.480
Oh, come to think of it...

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:15.360
Who were those two girls we
saw kissing the other day?

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.520
You're going to bring it up now?

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:26.510
I couldn't say; I never saw their faces.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.500
Doesn't it make you happy, though?

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.760
Knowing that there are others like you.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:37.010
Even though I've finally found them,
they already have each other.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:41.670
Even if we become friends, I'd still be alone.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.500
I want to tell her.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:48.390
If she wished it, I'd be her partner any day.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:54.400
I want one too — a cute girlfriend like Akemi-chan.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:56.390
I want to tell her!

00:02:56.390 --> 00:03:00.100
I want to tell her that she's really a guy!

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:03.610
Where could she be?

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:06.170
The girl whom I'm destined to be with.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.230
Then, do you want to look for her?

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:17.770
First year, class one — Furutaka Kako-san.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:21.520
I've heard that she used to be
a model in middle school.

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.300
From class three, Wakaba Kasuga-san.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.680
She's the most popular among the boys!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.220
Class four — Akitsuki Isuzu-san.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.410
Her aunt is an actress!

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.450
Now, as for other girls whom you might like—

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:54.460
Ow! Miyako had an accident!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:58.710
Oh no! Princess Miyako has fallen!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.200
Princess! Are you hurt?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.720
Someone get an ice pack!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.320
What a sinful hallway!

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.020
That's Taema Miyako-chan from our class.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:12.390
She's also incredibly popular among the boys.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.100
Yeah, I guess so.

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.440
She does seem like the type
you'd want to protect.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.660
You're such a bad girl.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:27.490
Really, Miyako.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.990
Tomoe-chan!

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:32.500
You mustn't disturb the others.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:48.570
Miyako, it's because you're so cute that people simply can't leave you alone, no matter what.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.060
Miyako will be careful.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.060
So please, don't let go of my hand.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.940
You're such a spoiled child.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.990
What is this blissful serenity before us?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.910
It's so soothing.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.670
Awesome!

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:10.580
Bravo!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:16.350
It looks like Taema-chan is on good terms with Hachisuka Tomoe-chan.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.850
No doubt about it — it was those two!

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.470
No matter how you look at it!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.820
Even here they're this transparent.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:37.260
Just how out of touch with the rest of my class am I?

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.860
All because I only have eyes for Kazama.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:44.390
I took a whole lot!

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:45.960
Thank you, Kiyori-chan.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.150
Well?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.990
Anyone strike your fancy?

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.860
I love them all!

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.660
What kind of answer is that?

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.000
But...

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:57.920
I saw you two yesterday.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.660
They're all so cute!

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:05.710
I want to have a tea party with all of them!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:06.150
Right?

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:06.800
Yep!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.550
What was that?!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.330
What do you want?

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:02.350
Regarding what you said in the hallway just now —
I assume you want something from me.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:06.990
It's not like we were really doing it, though.

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.620
Anyway, if you start spreading weird rumors and end up hurting Kazama...

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:19.880
Come now, Murasame-kun.

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.870
You make it sound like I'm trying to extort you.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.990
How rude.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:30.260
Tomoe-chan would never resort
to such base methods.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:34.510
I'm sorry. But then... why?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:42.520
We're looking for comrades.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:44.550
Comrades?

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.020
Yes!

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.690
Murasame-kun!

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:51.850
A girls' club. A club for girls, by girls.

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.530
Wouldn't you like to form one?

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.360
The Girls' Club.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:06.040
A serene haven for girls who like girls, yet by some cruel twist of fate wound up in a co-ed school.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.550
Boys and their ilk will never be seen, nor figure in conversation.

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:14.670
The tranquil hours after school will be spent exclusively with girls,

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:18.970
and we will revel in the sheer beauty
and elegance of it all!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:28.570
So, is there a point to creating a club like that?

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.590
Are you a fool?

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.570
High school is all about clubs!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.860
I guess...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.950
I'm sorry; I can't keep up with you two.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.960
Oh, really? You're going to turn us down?

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:55.470
Then, I guess I'll just have to
send this picture to everyone.

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:01.340
Weren't you going to refrain from such base methods?

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:06.670
That only goes for Tomoe-chan.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:16.800
Miyako may look like she'd never harm a fly,
but in reality, she'd crush it without a second thought.

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:22.490
Besides, Kazama and I don't have
that kind of relationship.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:26.640
What happened yesterday was just practice.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:31.370
Well, you probably can't tell from the picture,
but Kazama was wearing a mask.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:35.700
Lies! Aren't the two of you always together?

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.900
That's because we're friends.

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:43.510
However, the way Murasame-kun looks at Kazama-kun suggests otherwise.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:48.020
Yeah, it's as if she'd like to devour her whole.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.110
Passionate, yet despairing.

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:58.110
At times, a beast; at others, a puppy.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:02.780
It can't be! Am I that obvious?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:05.020
So you're the occasionally soft type.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:08.750
In other words,
you have an unrequited crush on her?

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:15.560
Damn it!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:19.760
Sumi-chan!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.780
K-Kazama!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.290
What are you doing here?

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:29.440
Welcome, fellow comrade!

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:34.400
Let's work together to make the Girls' Club a reality!

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:39.850
What? The Girls' Club?

00:10:39.850 --> 00:10:44.410
You can safely ignore her. She's just a fool.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:52.880
Well, you see, the Girls' Club...

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:09.390
We'll be looking forward to a favorable response from the two of you.

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:14.260
So those two were the ones kissing?

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.580
Y-Yeah, they were.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:22.900
In any case, they're so silly.

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:27.050
The school would never permit something as stupid as a Girls' Club—

00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:27.960
That's right...

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:29.290
That's right!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:36.290
If we made a club, then only the girls interested in that sort of thing would join!

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:41.050
And among them there'd surely
be someone who'd like me!

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:47.510
Ah, I wonder if any cute girls would join?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.810
I knew it'd turn out like this!

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:56.660
But you wouldn't join a club like that, would you?

00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:01.320
Since you don't like girls that way.

00:12:02.210 --> 00:12:04.980
Well, yeah...

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.870
I guess it wouldn't work, then.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:16.840
If I were to join a club,
it'd have to be with you, Sumi-chan.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:21.090
I understand.

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.090
Let's do it together!

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.600
We'll make the Girls' Club a reality!

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.690
Girls? Like them? Of course I'll like them!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:33.560
Sumi-chan?

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:39.850
The cute little girls you like — we'll gather them all!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.780
Did she break?

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:05.630
You there! Would you like to join the Girls' Club?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.140
I politely decline.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.080
She's not coming today, huh?

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:36.580
Now then, just one more person.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:40.610
How am I going to find her?

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:46.520
They're all unreliable.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:59.080
You want me to?

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:00.400
Correct.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:04.400
Tell the chosen targets that you like them,
and see how they react.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.750
There are all sorts of problems attached to doing this with actual students.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.000
That's insane!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.220
What if people find out?

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.450
Then, would you like to join the club?

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:18.170
If you don't, I'll spill the beans.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.170
You're so mean!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.860
First off, this girl.

00:14:23.860 --> 00:14:25.510
Furutaka Kako-san.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:35.100
Kako, did you do all the English translations?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.260
If you did, let me see them!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.320
Okay.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.480
Um...

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:44.120
Furutaka-san.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:48.240
May I have a moment of your time?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.830
Sure, but what is this about?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:56.940
Who is she?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:11.110
I love you! Please go out with me!

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:12.720
Hey! Wait, what are you...

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.650
Let go!

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:16.220
Who are you?

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.020
I was just passing by!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.120
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.850
Don't pull such weird pranks on me!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.140
It's not like that!

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:22.640
Stop it!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:23.400
Furutaka Kako.
Stop it!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:24.170
Furutaka Kako.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.110
A failure.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.590
Are you the one who gave me this letter?

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:38.620
Yes.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:44.880
I'm sorry; have we met before?

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.780
No, this is the first time.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:57.910
But... I... have always harbored feelings for you!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:05.460
Please let me call you "Onee-sama"!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.900
We may be the same age, but—

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.010
I'm not into that!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:10.090
You're quite the actor, Akemiya-kun.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:10.740
Just a little is fine!
You're quite the actor, Akemiya-kun.

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.150
Just a little is fine!

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.250
Get away from me!

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.610
Wakaba Kasuga.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.090
A failure.

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.410
Take that!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:24.170
Furthermore, she's good at judo.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.170
You there!

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.120
Would you like to join the Girls' Club?

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.940
If you join now, we'll let you become one of us.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.440
Shameless!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:57.140
Shame...

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.240
...less?

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:02.580
Kiyori-chan?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.050
Did you see Sumi-chan?

00:17:06.610 --> 00:17:10.450
We were supposed to look for prospective members together, but I can't find her.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:11.710
Murasame-san?

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.660
She vanished without a word yesterday as well.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.980
Geez, Sumi-chan.

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.790
I saw her by the greenhouse.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:21.710
Thanks.

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.210
Would you be my little sister?

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:47.670
We may be the same age, but—

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.490
Pervert!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:07.560
All the girls Kiyori-chan suggested
are out the window.

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.610
I guess they aren't everywhere.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:16.700
Um, I've been deeply traumatized
as a result of this ordeal.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:23.740
Even if I'm a boy, being called a pervert after telling a girl that I like her is...

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:30.730
I guess it's not unreasonable considering I'm wearing this, but psychologically it's—

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:33.250
I wonder if we're missing something?

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:38.010
Are you just going to ignore my views on this?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:41.010
Let's have you wear your usual wig.

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:48.520
Wait here while I find an appropriate girl.

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.830
Hurry back, would you?

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:03.950
Did you hear about the mysterious girl?

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:06.250
The one who blurts out confessions of love?

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.910
That's pretty scary!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.720
I can't afford to waste any more time.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:19.300
I must find one Kazama would approve of.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:20.810
I'll be going, then.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.200
I'll put this down first.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.300
Sure, I'll wait.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.130
But what should I do?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:34.310
What if I find a girl like that, and she and Kazama fall in love with each other?

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:38.860
Even so, I...

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:46.280
As long as Kazama is happy, I would...

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:11.350
All right, I'm done.

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:15.460
I just have to pick someone at random.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:19.860
Excuse me.

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:20.780
Oh, Murasame-san. Are you by yourself?

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.480
Oh, it's Kiyori-chan.
Oh, Murasame-san. Are you by yourself?

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.270
Oh, Murasame-san. Are you by yourself?

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.270
Ushio-chan was looking for you.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:27.870
Huh?

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:32.870
I told her that you were around the greenhouse.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:39.710
Oh no! Not there!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.720
My destined one...

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.730
So, that makes it:

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:02.740
Murasame Sumika.

00:21:03.380 --> 00:21:04.740
Kazama Ushio.

00:21:05.340 --> 00:21:06.870
Taema Miyako.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.010
Hachisuka Tomoe.

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:12.870
And the transfer student, Yamazaki Akemi.

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:18.640
With the five of us here, we now have the members required to establish the Girls' Club!

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:24.660
I didn't omit anything, did I, Kiyori-kun?

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:27.550
Nope; it'll be fun!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:34.900
But I'm a boy!

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:37.270
It's fine as long as the others don't figure it out.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:41.740
I'll make sure that you're registered as Akemiya-kun on the application form.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:48.780
Now, a toast to commemorate this meeting!

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:53.700
Cheers!

00:23:26.910 --> 00:23:27.690
Rejected.

00:23:29.820 --> 00:23:31.420
I thought as much.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:34.350
Just what were you girls thinking?

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:38.160
I'm here!

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:39.510
So you are.

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:42.620
How nice for everyone to dress up as maids.

00:23:42.620 --> 00:23:46.180
Just so you know,
maids don't actually do the eating.

00:23:48.520 --> 00:23:49.630
I'm done!

00:23:49.630 --> 00:23:51.400
Then, see you next week.
